# Kurrent design docs

Prose: `Design.md` (repo root). Tokens: `plasmoid/com.github.shrippen.kurrent/contents/ui/Design.qml`. Accents: `contents/ui/colors.js`.

Whenever you add or change a visual/UX decision (spacing, overlay, scrollbars, sizing, icons, editors, writable calendars, pending/sync UI, DnD, panel/desktop chrome), **in the same change**:

1. Update `Design.md` (why + rule).
2. If it is a measurable token, add or adjust it in `Design.qml` and use that token in QML — do not invent a one-off `Kirigami.Units.*Spacing`.

Do not ship a UI change that leaves `Design.md` stale. There is no watcher; this rule is the update mechanism.

Use `Design.spaceTiny|Small|Medium|Large`, `padInner`, `padEditor`, `overlayInset`. Full editor: overlay card inside the plasmoid, dim over the **entire visual widget** including sidebar and Plasma chrome. Multiline fields: `ScrollableTextArea`, not `ScrollView`. Fill-height lists: `implicitHeight: 0`.
